   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Synthetic passive with «se»",
     "texto": [
      "With a transitive verb, **se** can form a passive: **Vende-se pão fresco** is equivalent to «fresh bread is sold»; **Vendem-se casas** is equivalent to «houses are sold». The noun that receives the action is the subject, so the verb agrees with it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Indefinite subject",
     "texto": [
      "In **Precisa-se de empregados** (staff needed), the verb stays singular: **de empregados** is introduced by a preposition and is not the subject of a passive. Also: **Trabalha-se muito aqui** (one works a lot here). In the negative, the pronoun goes before: **não se fuma** (one doesn't smoke)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
